{
  "name": "Kanallar — Cloud orchestration (not production brain)",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Triggers Kanallar cloud worker only. YouTube OAuth stays on the worker (YOUTUBE_TOKEN_JSON). Do not rebuild video pipeline inside n8n."
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched-daily",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 UTC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{$env.KANALLAR_BASE_URL}}/health",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-health",
      "name": "Worker health",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.ok}}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-healthy",
      "name": "Healthy?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [500, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.KANALLAR_BASE_URL}}/api/produce",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-produce",
      "name": "Start produce",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [760, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "wait-render",
      "name": "Wait ~3 min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1000, -80],
      "webhookId": "kanallar-wait-produce"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{$env.KANALLAR_BASE_URL}}/api/pending",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-pending",
      "name": "List pending approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1240, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst pending = items[0].json;\nconst list = Array.isArray(pending) ? pending : [];\nconst base = $env.KANALLAR_BASE_URL || '';\nif (!list.length) {\n  return [{ json: { message: 'Onay bekleyen video yok', count: 0, studio: base + '/' } }];\n}\nconst lines = list.map(v => `- ${v.id} (${Math.round(v.duration||0)}s) izle: ${base}/media/${v.id}`);\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    count: list.length,\n    message: `Onay bekleyen ${list.length} video:\\n` + lines.join('\\n') + `\\n\\nStudio: ${base}/`,\n    first_id: list[0].id,\n    studio: base + '/'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "fmt-pending",
      "name": "Format notify text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1480, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sonraki adım (manuel veya Telegram/Slack node ekle)\n\n1. `message` alanındaki Studio linkini aç (telefon/Dell)\n2. Videoyu izle → **Onayla + yükle**\n3. YouTube yükleme **worker** üzerinde çalışır (Mac token secret ile)\n\nİstersen bu node'dan sonra Telegram / Slack / Email node bağla; `{{$json.message}}` gönder.\n\n**YouTube node kullanma** — OAuth zaten Mac'te alındı; ikinci bağlama gereksiz ve karışır.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "note-approve",
      "name": "Note: approve in Studio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1720, -200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Worker unhealthy\n\n`KANALLAR_BASE_URL` yanlış veya worker kapalı.\nÖnce Docker/Railway deploy + `/health` kontrol et.\nn8n video üretmez.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "note-unhealthy",
      "name": "Note: unhealthy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [760, 120]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 UTC": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Worker health", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Worker health": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Healthy?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Healthy?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Start produce", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Start produce": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Wait ~3 min", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Wait ~3 min": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "List pending approval", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "List pending approval": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Format notify text", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "tags": [
    { "name": "kanallar" },
    { "name": "orchestration-only" }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "1"
}
